{"id":"mc902001ee8","name":"S真天下布武","aliases":["真天下布武","しんてんかふぶ","上原亜衣"],"maker":"山佐・セブンリーグ","thumb":"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/stenka-t.png","isNew":false,"sources":{"lab":true,"ev":false},"lab":{"specHtml":"<div id=\"post\">\n    <div class=\"tab\">\n        <!--TODO 消す-->\n        <h1 class=\"setting\">設定狙い：設定判別</h1>\n        \n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">まずはココを見ろ！</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">設定判別項目</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>確定演出</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>項目</th>\n                            <th>重要度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\"><a class=\"source-link1\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">AT終了画面とケロットトロフィー</a></td>\n                            <td>★★★☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\"><a class=\"source-link2\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">エンディング中のランプ</a></td>\n                            <td>★★☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>通常時</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>項目</th>\n                            <th>重要度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\"><a class=\"source-link3\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">AT直撃</a></td>\n                            <td>★★★★☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\"><a class=\"source-link4\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">一騎駆けの武将</a></td>\n                            <td>★★☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\"><a class=\"source-link5\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">モード移行率</a></td>\n                            <td>★★★☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">ざっくり設定判別</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">ツモった際のやめ時</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>大まかな目安</h3>\n                <h4>やめ推奨時間</h4>\n                <p>閉店1時間半前以降のメニュー画面青以下かつモードが悪い(有利区間転落後)もしくは信長A、信長Bならやめ。</p>\n                <h4>閉店欠損度</h4>\n                <p>★★★☆☆</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>解説</h3>\n                <p>6.5号機のため有利区間を4000ゲームうまく使う機種であるため、低モード時は出玉が作りにくくなっている。</p>\n                <p>高設定ほど有利区間突入時から秀吉モードにはいりやすくミミズグラフを描きやすくなっているため、閉店時間が迫っているときに信長モードを選択されると辛くなるため早めに見切ってもいいでしょう。</p>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">スペック</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>CZ・AT初当り確率</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th>CZ</th>\n                            <th>AT初当り</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定L</td>\n                            <td>−</td>\n                            <td>−</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>1/116.7</td>\n                            <td>1/374.5</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>1/110.3</td>\n                            <td>1/337.9</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>1/97.7</td>\n                            <td>1/267.7</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>1/86.0</td>\n                            <td>1/206.2</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1/75.9</td>\n                            <td>1/166.9</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>出玉率</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th>出玉率</th>\n                            <th>勝率</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定L</td>\n                            <td>−</td>\n                            <td>−</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>97.7%</td>\n                            <td>40.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>99.0%</td>\n                            <td>44.7%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>103.0%</td>\n                            <td>60.6%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>108.5%</td>\n                            <td>80.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>112.2%</td>\n                            <td>92.8%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <figcaption class=\"left\">(※)勝率は7000G消化時点</figcaption>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n       \n        <p class=\"js-menu\">基本情報</p>\n<div class=\"contents\">\n    <div class=\"left\">\n        <h3>天井・打ち方・詳細情報</h3>\n        <table border=\"1\">\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <th style=\"width: 50%;\">項目</th>\n              